a-x & c & b \\
c & b-x & a \\
b & a & c-x
\end{array}\right|=0 \text{$ is }

questions.solution:
$\begin{aligned}
\left|\begin{array}{ccc}
a-x & c & b \\
c & b-x & a \\
b & a & c-x
\end{array}\right|=0 \\ -\left|\begin{array}{ccc}
x-(a+b+c) & c & b \\
x-(a+b+c) & b-x & a \\
x-(a+b+c) & a & c-x
\end{array}\right|=0 \\ \Rightarrow\left|\begin{array}{ccc}
x & c & b \\
x & b-x & a \\
x & a & c-x
\end{array}\right|=0 \\ \left\{\text{ Applying } \mathrm{C}_1 \rightarrow \mathrm{C}_1+\mathrm{C}_2+\mathrm{C}_3\right. \text{ \} } \\ \left|\begin{array}{ccc}
x & c & b \\
0 & c+x-b & b-a \\
0 & c-a & b+x-c
\end{array}\right|=0 \\ \text{ \{Applying } \mathrm{R}_2 \rightarrow \mathrm{R}_1-\mathrm{R}_2 \text{ and } \mathrm{R}_3 \rightarrow \mathrm{R}_1-\mathrm{R}_3 \text{ \} } \\ x\{(c+x-b)(b+x-c)-(b-a)(c-a)\}=0 \\ x\left\{\left(x^2-(b-c)^2-b c+a c+a b-a^2\right\}=0\right. \\ x\left(x^2-a^2-b^2-c^2+a b+b c+c a\right)=0 \\ x\left\{x^2-(a-b)^2-(b-c)^2-(c-a)^2\right\}=0 \\  \begin{array}{ll}
\therefore & x=0 \\
\end{array} 
\end{aligned}$

